2. In this Order —
“Agency” means the Singapore Food Agency established by section 3 of the Singapore Food Agency Act 2019;
“in-principle LRP status” has the meaning given by regulation 2 of the Singapore Food Agency (Certification Marks) Regulations 2019 (G.N. No. S 282/2019);
“Laboratory Recognition Programme” or “LRP” has the meaning given by regulation 2 of the Singapore Food Agency (Certification Marks) Regulations 2019;
“LRP certificate of recognition” has the meaning given by regulation 2 of the Singapore Food Agency (Certification Marks) Regulations 2019.
